# Rhino's Rampage: Bot1's Grizzly Bears (2/2) gets +1/+0 and fights Bot2's Memnite (1/1): 3 damage to a 1-toughness creature is
# 2 excess damage (CR 120.10), so the reflexive ability destroys up to one target noncreature artifact with mana value 3 or less.
# Bot2 has a Sol Ring (mana value 1, legal), the Memnite (an artifact creature, refused) and a Gathering Stone (mana value 4,
# refused). Bot1 destroys the Sol Ring; the Bears take 1 from the Memnite and survive.

